{"parents": [{"link": "../../", "title": "API Reference"}, {"link": "../", "title": "auth_server"}], "prev": {"link": "../my_account_client/", "title": "auth_server.my_account_client"}, "next": {"link": "../server_client/", "title": "auth_server.server_client"}, "title": "auth_server.passwordless_client", "meta": {}, "body": "<section id=\"module-auth_server.passwordless_client\">\n<span id=\"auth-server-passwordless-client\"></span><h1>auth_server.passwordless_client<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#module-auth_server.passwordless_client\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h1>\n<p>Passwordless Client for auth0-server-python SDK.</p>\n<p>Implements embedded passwordless login for a client:</p>\n<ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p>Email OTP / SMS OTP - <code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">start()</span></code> sends a code, <code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">verify()</span></code> exchanges it for\ntokens via the passwordless-OTP grant and establishes a server-side session.</p></li>\n<li><p>Magic link - <code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">start(send=&quot;link&quot;)</span></code> emails a one-click link. Completion is\nhandled by the standard callback (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">ServerClient.complete_interactive_login</span></code>),\nnot by <code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">verify()</span></code>.</p></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Tokens never leave the server. The browser holds only the opaque session.</p>\n<p class=\"rubric\">Import</p>\n<div class=\"highlight-python notranslate\"><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">auth0_server_python.auth_server.passwordless_client</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">PasswordlessClient</span>\n</pre></div>\n</div>\n<section id=\"module-contents\">\n<h2>Module Contents<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#module-contents\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h2>\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth_server.passwordless_client.PasswordlessClient\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">PasswordlessClient</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">server_client</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../server_client/#auth_server.server_client.ServerClient\" title=\"auth_server.server_client.ServerClient\"><span class=\"pre\">auth0_server_python.auth_server.server_client.ServerClient</span></a></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://github.com/auth0/auth0-server-python/blob/main/src/auth0_server_python/auth_server/passwordless_client.py#L50\"><span class=\"viewcode-link\"><span class=\"pre\">[source]</span></span></a><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth_server.passwordless_client.PasswordlessClient\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Client for Auth0 embedded passwordless operations.</p>\n<p>Composes the parent <code class=\"xref py py-class docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">ServerClient</span></code> to reuse domain resolution, OIDC\ndiscovery, JWKS/ID-token verification, and session persistence.</p>\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth_server.passwordless_client.PasswordlessClient.start\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">async</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">start</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">options</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">auth0_server_python.auth_types.StartPasswordlessOptions</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">store_options</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#dict\" title=\"(in Python v3.15)\"><span class=\"pre\">dict</span></a><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">[</span></span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.15)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">,</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/library/typing.html#typing.Any\" title=\"(in Python v3.15)\"><span class=\"pre\">Any</span></a><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">]</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/constants.html#None\" title=\"(in Python v3.15)\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></a></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../auth_types/#auth_types.PasswordlessStartResult\" title=\"auth_types.PasswordlessStartResult\"><span class=\"pre\">auth0_server_python.auth_types.PasswordlessStartResult</span></a></span></span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://github.com/auth0/auth0-server-python/blob/main/src/auth0_server_python/auth_server/passwordless_client.py#L63\"><span class=\"viewcode-link\"><span class=\"pre\">[source]</span></span></a><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth_server.passwordless_client.PasswordlessClient.start\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Start a passwordless flow by sending an OTP code or a magic link.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>options</strong> \u2013 <code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">StartPasswordlessEmailOptions</span></code> or\n<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">StartPasswordlessSmsOptions</span></code>.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>store_options</strong> \u2013 Options passed to the transaction store (e.g.\nrequest/response). Required for the magic-link flow so the\ntransaction cookie can be written.</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>PasswordlessStartResult with Auth0\u2019s start response payload.</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Raises<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../error/#error.PasswordlessStartError\" title=\"error.PasswordlessStartError\"><strong>PasswordlessStartError</strong></a> \u2013 When <code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">POST</span> <span class=\"pre\">/passwordless/start</span></code> fails.</p></li>\n<li><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../error/#error.InvalidArgumentError\" title=\"error.InvalidArgumentError\"><strong>InvalidArgumentError</strong></a> \u2013 When <code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">options</span></code> is not a recognized type, or\ncaller <code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">auth_params</span></code> contains an SDK-owned or unrecognized key.</p></li>\n<li><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../error/#error.MissingRequiredArgumentError\" title=\"error.MissingRequiredArgumentError\"><strong>MissingRequiredArgumentError</strong></a> \u2013 When a magic link is requested but no\n<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">redirect_uri</span></code> is configured on the client, or <code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">store_options</span></code>\nis not provided.</p></li>\n<li><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../error/#error.ConfigurationError\" title=\"error.ConfigurationError\"><strong>ConfigurationError</strong></a> \u2013 When client authentication is not configured.</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth_server.passwordless_client.PasswordlessClient.verify\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">async</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">verify</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">options</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../auth_types/#auth_types.VerifyPasswordlessOtpOptions\" title=\"auth_types.VerifyPasswordlessOtpOptions\"><span class=\"pre\">auth0_server_python.auth_types.VerifyPasswordlessOtpOptions</span></a></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">store_options</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#dict\" title=\"(in Python v3.15)\"><span class=\"pre\">dict</span></a><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">[</span></span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.15)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">,</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/library/typing.html#typing.Any\" title=\"(in Python v3.15)\"><span class=\"pre\">Any</span></a><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">]</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/constants.html#None\" title=\"(in Python v3.15)\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></a></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#dict\" title=\"(in Python v3.15)\"><span class=\"pre\">dict</span></a><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">[</span></span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.15)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">,</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/library/typing.html#typing.Any\" title=\"(in Python v3.15)\"><span class=\"pre\">Any</span></a><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">]</span></span></span></span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://github.com/auth0/auth0-server-python/blob/main/src/auth0_server_python/auth_server/passwordless_client.py#L172\"><span class=\"viewcode-link\"><span class=\"pre\">[source]</span></span></a><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth_server.passwordless_client.PasswordlessClient.verify\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Verify a passwordless OTP and establish a server-side session.</p>\n<p>Only for the OTP flows (email/SMS code). Magic link completes via the\nstandard callback handler, not here.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>options</strong> \u2013 VerifyPasswordlessOtpOptions.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>store_options</strong> \u2013 Options passed to the state store (e.g.\nrequest/response) so the session can be written.</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>Dict containing <code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">state_data</span></code> for the established session.</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Raises<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../error/#error.PasswordlessVerifyError\" title=\"error.PasswordlessVerifyError\"><strong>PasswordlessVerifyError</strong></a> \u2013 When token exchange or ID-token\nverification fails.</p></li>\n<li><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../error/#error.MfaRequiredError\" title=\"error.MfaRequiredError\"><strong>MfaRequiredError</strong></a> \u2013 When Auth0 requires MFA before completing login.</p></li>\n<li><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../error/#error.ApiError\" title=\"error.ApiError\"><strong>ApiError</strong></a> \u2013 When fetching the JWKS used to verify the ID token fails.</p></li>\n<li><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../error/#error.SessionExpiredError\" title=\"error.SessionExpiredError\"><strong>SessionExpiredError</strong></a> \u2013 When the token\u2019s session-expiry ceiling is\nalready in the past.</p></li>\n<li><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../error/#error.ConfigurationError\" title=\"error.ConfigurationError\"><strong>ConfigurationError</strong></a> \u2013 When client authentication is not configured.</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py data\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth_server.passwordless_client.DEFAULT_PASSWORDLESS_EMAIL_SCOPE\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">DEFAULT_PASSWORDLESS_EMAIL_SCOPE</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">'openid</span> <span class=\"pre\">profile</span> <span class=\"pre\">email'</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth_server.passwordless_client.DEFAULT_PASSWORDLESS_EMAIL_SCOPE\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py data\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth_server.passwordless_client.DEFAULT_PASSWORDLESS_SMS_SCOPE\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">DEFAULT_PASSWORDLESS_SMS_SCOPE</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">'openid</span> <span class=\"pre\">profile'</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth_server.passwordless_client.DEFAULT_PASSWORDLESS_SMS_SCOPE\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py data\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth_server.passwordless_client.FORWARDED_FOR_HEADER\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">FORWARDED_FOR_HEADER</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">'auth0-forwarded-for'</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth_server.passwordless_client.FORWARDED_FOR_HEADER\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py data\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth_server.passwordless_client.PASSWORDLESS_OTP_GRANT_TYPE\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">PASSWORDLESS_OTP_GRANT_TYPE</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">'http://auth0.com/oauth/grant-type/passwordless/otp'</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth_server.passwordless_client.PASSWORDLESS_OTP_GRANT_TYPE\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n</section>\n</section>\n", "metatags": "<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n", "rellinks": [["genindex", "General Index", "I", "index"], ["py-modindex", "Python Module Index", "", "modules"], ["reference/auth_server/server_client/index", "auth_server.server_client", "N", "next"], ["reference/auth_server/my_account_client/index", "auth_server.my_account_client", "P", "previous"]], "sourcename": "reference/auth_server/passwordless_client/index.rst.txt", "toc": "<ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#\">auth_server.passwordless_client</a><ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#module-contents\">Module Contents</a><ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_server.passwordless_client.PasswordlessClient\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">PasswordlessClient</span></code></a><ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_server.passwordless_client.PasswordlessClient.start\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">PasswordlessClient.start()</span></code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_server.passwordless_client.PasswordlessClient.verify\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">PasswordlessClient.verify()</span></code></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_server.passwordless_client.DEFAULT_PASSWORDLESS_EMAIL_SCOPE\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">DEFAULT_PASSWORDLESS_EMAIL_SCOPE</span></code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_server.passwordless_client.DEFAULT_PASSWORDLESS_SMS_SCOPE\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">DEFAULT_PASSWORDLESS_SMS_SCOPE</span></code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_server.passwordless_client.FORWARDED_FOR_HEADER\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">FORWARDED_FOR_HEADER</span></code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_server.passwordless_client.PASSWORDLESS_OTP_GRANT_TYPE\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">PASSWORDLESS_OTP_GRANT_TYPE</span></code></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n", "display_toc": true, "page_source_suffix": ".rst", "current_page_name": "reference/auth_server/passwordless_client/index", "sidebars": ["about.html", "navigation.html", "relations.html", "searchbox.html", "donate.html"], "alabaster_version": "0.7.16", "alabaster_version_info": [0, 7, 16]}